          "text": "Yes — Purang (Burang) County in Ngari Prefecture is home to both Mount Kailash and Lake Manasarovar. Its county seat, Purang Town (Taklakot), sits about 20 km from the Nepal border, and most pilgrims coming from Nepal and India pass through it.",
